<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Riyad Bank posts 809 mln riyals net in 96.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Riyad Bank posts 809 mln riyals net in 96.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia's Riyad Bank said on Sunday it posted a net profit of 809 million riyals ($215.7 million) in 1996, up 5.9 percent on 764 million riyals in 1995.</p>
<p>A bank statement said its board of directors had recommended a 600 million riyal dividend to shareholders for 1996, or 15 riyals per share, unchanged from the previous year.</p>
<p>($1=3.75 riyals)</p>
</text>
